  "title": "Towny Residency",
  "description": "A Plugin that goes into the roleplay aspects of residency within Towny.",
  "body": "# Towny Residency\nTowny Residency is a plugin that adds a \"Residency Paper\" a form of ID Card, intended to use alongside [Towny](https://github.com/TownyAdvanced/Towny) (hard dependency) for RP purposes.\n\n## Commands:\n\n**residency:**\\\ndescription: Gives out your own Residency Paper. \\\nusage: `/residency`\n\n\n## Images:\n<figure>\n  <img alt=\"Empty Residency Paper\" src=\"https://github.com/NikDev26/TownyResidency/blob/main/TR_RP_empty.png?raw=true\" width=\"300\">\n  <figcaption>Residency Paper when not being resident of a Town nor Nation, having no Title and no Ranks.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<br><br>\n<figure>\n  <img alt=\"Residency Paper with Entries\" src=\"https://github.com/NikDev26/TownyResidency/blob/main/TR_RP_w-entry.png?raw=true\" width=\"300\">\n  <figcaption>Residency Paper with entries. Town, Nation, Title & Ranks.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<br><br>\n<figure>\n  <img alt=\"Residency Paper DateTime\" src=\"https://github.com/NikDev26/TownyResidency/blob/main/TR_RP_DateTime.png?raw=true\" width=\"300\">\n  <figcaption>Residency Paper Date & Time timestamp when issued, on page 2 of the Residency Paper.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
